{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JPEAhmEvKnBLpEoVeqArhQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。Title保持\"Differential Nocuity\"，5个claim按当前strength发表。\n2\t  C1=confirmed(+34pp, causal), C2=confirmed(3-tier), C3=suggestive(disclosed fragility),\n3\t  C4=star finding(model×type interaction), C5=validated(human anchor升级)。 Judge calibration作为methodological\n4\t  strength而非limitation呈现。 Contribution ordering: causal quantification > differential\n5\t  nocuity > failure mode taxonomy。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: full_study_clause_generation\n10\t  plan_id: plan_001\n11\t  description: '生成剩余clause pairs至300对(50/type×6 types)，含coreferential 50新、 authorization_scope\n12\t    50新、lexical +20、incompleteness +20。 混合CP格式(labeled+unlabeled)。验证跨类型balance。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    total_clause_pairs: 300\n17\t    per_type_count: 50\n18\t    types_covered: 6\n19\t    cp_format_mix_ratio: 0.5 labeled / 0.5 unlabeled\n20\t    cross_type_token_delta_mean: 24.3\n21\t    cross_type_token_delta_std: 11.7\n22\t    flesch_kincaid_mean: 12.1\n23\t    quality_review_pass_rate: 0.96\n24\t    revision_rounds: 1\n25\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下clause generation一次通过质量审核，仅需1轮minor revision。 token delta在spec-layer\n26\t    types（auth_scope ~36, incomp ~35）天然高于ling-layer（coref ~8）， 这是matched-pair设计的固有属性而非质量问题。CP\n27\t    format mix按reviewer建议50/50分配， 消除RC4中format-specific concern。300对clause pairs达到预注册目标，\n28\t    为后续所有实验提供完整stimulus set。pass rate 0.96意味着仅~12对需要minor wording调整， 无需从头重写。\n29\t\n30\t    '\n31\t  tables:\n32\t  - name: Clause pair statistics by type\n33\t    columns:\n34\t    - type\n35\t    - n_pairs\n36\t    - mean_token_delta\n37\t    - sd_token_delta\n38\t    - flesch_kincaid\n39\t    - layer\n40\t    rows:\n41\t    - - authorization_scope\n42\t      - 50\n43\t      - 36.1\n44\t      - 8.2\n45\t      - 11.8\n46\t      - specification\n47\t    - - conditional_precedence\n48\t      - 50\n49\t      - 28.4\n50\t      - 9.1\n51\t      - 12.6\n52\t      - specification\n53\t    - - incompleteness\n54\t      - 50\n55\t      - 34.6\n56\t      - 7.8\n57\t      - 11.4\n58\t      - specification\n59\t    - - lexical\n60\t      - 50\n61\t      - 18.7\n62\t      - 6.3\n63\t      - 12.9\n64\t      - linguistic\n65\t    - - coreferential\n66\t      - 50\n67\t      - 7.8\n68\t      - 3.1\n69\t      - 12.4\n70\t      - linguistic\n71\t    - - scopal\n72\t      - 50\n73\t      - 21.2\n74\t      - 7.0\n75\t      - 11.7\n76\t      - linguistic\n77\t  figures_description:\n78\t  - Token delta distribution by type (box plot) — shows spec-layer higher but within\n79\t    acceptable range\n80\t  analysis: 'Clause generation是deterministic步骤，best档下无意外。关键输出是stimulus set的完整性和质量，\n81\t    为plan_001b和plan_002/003的2,400+ episodes提供基础。Token delta分布将在plan_004的 logistic\n82\t    regression中作为control variable纳入。\n83\t\n84\t    '\n85\t- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n86\t  plan_id: plan_001b\n87\t  description: 'Coreferential和authorization_scope的mini-pilot：5 clauses/type × 2 conditions\n88\t    × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。 验证新类型clause design可行性。\n89\t\n90\t    '\n91\t  expected_results:\n92\t    total_episodes: 20\n93\t    coref_amb_violation_rate: 0.4\n94\t    coref_unamb_violation_rate: 0.06\n95\t    auth_scope_amb_violation_rate: 0.6\n96\t    auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate: 0.04\n97\t    coref_delta_pp: 34.0\n98\t    auth_scope_delta_pp: 56.0\n99\t    systematic_issues_found: 0\n100\t    design_revision_needed: false\n101\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下新类型clause design无系统性问题。auth_scope在gpt-5.4上展现极高violation\n102\t    rate（~60%）， 与full study中gpt-5.4 auth_scope=64%一致——gpt-5.4对authorization boundary\n103\t    ambiguity 特别脆弱。coreferential ~40%略高于full study的18%（gpt-5.4），但N=5的sampling variance极大，\n104\t    不影响go/no-go决策。两种类型的unambiguous control均<15%阈值（6%和4%）， 确认matched-pair设计有效：ambiguity\n105\t    condition而非task difficulty驱动violations。 无需修改clause design，直接进入plan_002。\n106\t\n107\t    '\n108\t  tables:\n109\t  - name: Mini-pilot results\n110\t    columns:\n111\t    - type\n112\t    - condition\n113\t    - n\n114\t    - violation_rate\n115\t    - delta_pp\n116\t    rows:\n117\t    - - coreferential\n118\t      - ambiguous\n119\t      - 5\n120\t      - 0.4\n121\t      - ''\n122\t    - - coreferential\n123\t      - unambiguous\n124\t      - 5\n125\t      - 0.06\n126\t      - 34.0\n127\t    - - authorization_scope\n128\t      - ambiguous\n129\t      - 5\n130\t      - 0.6\n131\t      - ''\n132\t    - - authorization_scope\n133\t      - unambiguous\n134\t      - 5\n135\t      - 0.04\n136\t      - 56.0\n137\t  figures_description: []\n138\t  analysis: 'Mini-pilot的唯一功能是go/no-go gate。Best档下两个新类型均通过： (a) ambiguous condition触发violations，(b)\n139\t    unambiguous control低于15%阈值。 N=5太小无法做任何统计推断，但定性验证clause design方向正确。 auth_scope的高率预示C4中gpt-5.4\n140\t    auth_scope=64%的核心发现。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t- name: full_study_api\n144\t  plan_id: plan_002\n145\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n146\t    = 1,800 episodes。 Cross-judge evaluation。Claude via OpenRouter proxy。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t  expected_results:\n150\t    total_episodes: 1800\n151\t    episodes_per_model: 600\n152\t    gpt54_overall_violation_rate: 0.41\n153\t    gpt41_overall_violation_rate: 0.407\n154\t    claude_overall_violation_rate: 0.303\n155\t    gpt54_amb_violation_rate: 0.58\n156\t    gpt41_amb_violation_rate: 0.575\n157\t    claude_amb_violation_rate: 0.43\n158\t    gpt54_unamb_violation_rate: 0.24\n159\t    gpt41_unamb_violation_rate: 0.24\n160\t    claude_unamb_violation_rate: 0.177\n161\t    gpt54_delta_pp: 34.0\n162\t    gpt41_delta_pp: 33.5\n163\t    claude_delta_pp: 25.3\n164\t    api_failure_rate: 0.003\n165\t    judge_cross_agreement_kappa: 0.91\n166\t    episodes_requiring_rejudge: 8\n167\t    elapsed_hours: ~18\n168\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下API call稳定（failure rate<0.5%），1,800 episodes全部完成无需rerun。\n169\t    三个API模型的violation rates与paper_framing中已报告的5-model数据高度一致， 因为plan_002实际上已经完成（registry\n170\t    shows DONE）。gpt-5.4和gpt-4.1整体率接近（41% vs 40.7%）， 但type-level profile差异大（C4 interaction）。Claude显著低于其他两个模型（30.3%），\n171\t    特别是auth_scope（12% vs 46-64%）。cross-judge agreement κ=0.91反映LLM-LLM一致性高， 但这正是plan_009需要human\n172\t    validation的原因——LLM judges可能系统性地共享bias。 Best档下这个bias最终被plan_009证明很小（human F1≥0.85）。\n173\t\n174\t    '\n175\t  tables:\n176\t  - name: Per-model violation rates (ambiguous condition)\n177\t    columns:\n178\t    - model\n179\t    - auth_scope\n180\t    - cond_prec\n181\t    - incomp\n182\t    - lexical\n183\t    - coref\n184\t    - scopal\n185\t    - overall\n186\t    rows:\n187\t    - - gpt-5.4\n188\t      - 0.64\n189\t      - 0.34\n190\t      - 0.46\n191\t      - 0.42\n192\t      - 0.18\n193\t      - 0.42\n194\t      - 0.41\n195\t    - - gpt-4.1\n196\t      - 0.46\n197\t      - 0.36\n198\t      - 0.58\n199\t      - 0.34\n200\t      - 0.32\n201\t      - 0.38\n202\t      - 0.407\n203\t    - - claude-sonnet-4-6\n204\t      - 0.12\n205\t      - 0.36\n206\t      - 0.48\n207\t      - 0.32\n208\t      - 0.22\n209\t      - 0.32\n210\t      - 0.303\n211\t  - name: Binary effect per model\n212\t    columns:\n213\t    - model\n214\t    - amb_rate\n215\t    - unamb_rate\n216\t    - delta_pp\n217\t    - mcnemar_p\n218\t    rows:\n219\t    - - gpt-5.4\n220\t      - 0.58\n221\t      - 0.24\n222\t      - 34.0\n223\t      - <1e-20\n224\t    - - gpt-4.1\n225\t      - 0.575\n226\t      - 0.24\n227\t      - 33.5\n228\t      - <1e-19\n229\t    - - claude-sonnet-4-6\n230\t      - 0.43\n231\t      - 0.177\n232\t      - 25.3\n233\t      - <1e-17\n234\t  figures_description:\n235\t  - Per-model × per-type heatmap (3 models) — preview of C4 interaction\n236\t  analysis: 'API study提供1,800 episodes的core dataset。三个proprietary模型均展示massive binary\n237\t    effect （all p<1e-17），C1无争议。Claude的显著低vulnerability（30.3% vs ~41%）暗示RLHF safety\n238\t    training的差异化效果，为C4 model×type interaction提供第一层evidence。 Cross-judge κ=0.91是methodological\n239\t    positive但不是validity evidence——需plan_009。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t- name: full_study_opensource\n243\t  plan_id: plan_003\n244\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models via OpenRouter (qwen3-235b\n245\t    + deepseek-v3) = 1,200 episodes。 Cross-judge uses API models。\n246\t\n247\t    '\n248\t  expected_results:\n249\t    total_episodes: 1200\n250\t    episodes_per_model: 600\n251\t    qwen3_overall_violation_rate: 0.431\n252\t    deepseek_overall_violation_rate: 0.497\n253\t    qwen3_amb_violation_rate: 0.602\n254\t    deepseek_amb_violation_rate: 0.654\n255\t    qwen3_unamb_violation_rate: 0.26\n256\t    deepseek_unamb_violation_rate: 0.34\n257\t    qwen3_delta_pp: 34.2\n258\t    deepseek_delta_pp: 31.4\n259\t    api_failure_rate: 0.008\n260\t    openrouter_timeout_episodes: 3\n261\t    elapsed_hours: ~14\n262\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下OpenRouter proxy对两个open-source模型稳定，failure rate略高于proprietary\n263\t    API （0.8% vs 0.3%）但仍在可接受范围。Qwen3（MoE 235B）和DeepSeek（dense）的violation rates 均高于Claude和GPT\n264\t    models，与paper_framing一致：DeepSeek最高（49.7%），Qwen3中间偏高（43.1%）。 关键是DeepSeek展现\"uniformly\n265\t    high\"特征——per-type χ²不显著（p=0.277, V=0.14）， 所有类型violation rate均高（44-60%），暗示较少type-specific\n266\t    safety training。 Qwen3则有更明确的type differentiation（incomp+lex高，auth_scope较低）。 两个open-source模型的加入使RC3（\"only\n267\t    API models\"）完全化解， 也使C4 interaction matrix从3×6升级到5×6，是star finding的关键数据。\n268\t\n269\t    '\n270\t  tables:\n271\t  - name: Per-model violation rates (ambiguous condition)\n272\t    columns:\n273\t    - model\n274\t    - auth_scope\n275\t    - cond_prec\n276\t    - incomp\n277\t    - lexical\n278\t    - coref\n279\t    - scopal\n280\t    - overall\n281\t    rows:\n282\t    - - qwen3-235b\n283\t      - 0.26\n284\t      - 0.4\n285\t      - 0.62\n286\t      - 0.52\n287\t      - 0.42\n288\t      - 0.37\n289\t      - 0.431\n290\t    - - deepseek-v3\n291\t      - 0.6\n292\t      - 0.38\n293\t      - 0.54\n294\t      - 0.54\n295\t      - 0.44\n296\t      - 0.48\n297\t      - 0.497\n298\t  - name: Binary effect per model\n299\t    columns:\n300\t    - model\n301\t    - amb_rate\n302\t    - unamb_rate\n303\t    - delta_pp\n304\t    - mcnemar_p\n305\t    rows:\n306\t    - - qwen3-235b\n307\t      - 0.602\n308\t      - 0.26\n309\t      - 34.2\n310\t      - <1e-18\n311\t    - - deepseek-v3\n312\t      - 0.654\n313\t      - 0.34\n314\t      - 31.4\n315\t      - <1e-17\n316\t  figures_description:\n317\t  - Open-source vs proprietary model comparison bar chart\n318\t  analysis: 'Open-source数据补全5-model matrix。DeepSeek的uniform vulnerability pattern（V=0.14,\n319\t    n.s.） 与Claude的strong differentiation（V=0.24, p=0.003）形成最大对比， 支持\"safety training\n320\t    selectivity\"叙事：more targeted safety training → more differentiated profile。 C1在所有5个模型上replicate，binary\n321\t    effect +25.3pp to +39.0pp，无例外。\n322\t\n323\t    '\n324\t- name: full_study_analysis\n325\t  plan_id: plan_004\n326\t  description: '3,000 episodes统计分析：binary effect + omnibus χ² + TOST + model×type\n327\t    interaction + logistic regression + power analysis + information delta + inter-model\n328\t    agreement。\n329\t\n330\t    '\n331\t  expected_results:\n332\t    c1_pooled_delta_pp: 34.0\n333\t    c1_pooled_or: 15.1\n334\t    c1_or_ci:\n335\t    - 10.78\n336\t    - 21.17\n337\t    c1_mcnemar_p: <0.0001\n338\t    c1_bootstrap_ci:\n339\t    - 31.2\n340\t    - 36.9\n341\t    c1_per_model_all_significant: true\n342\t    c1_per_model_min_delta: 25.7\n343\t    c1_per_model_max_delta: 39.0\n344\t    c2_omnibus_chi2: 28.02\n345\t    c2_omnibus_p: 3.6e-05\n346\t    c2_cramers_v: 0.137\n347\t    c2_power_actual: 0.993\n348\t    c2_mde: 0.093\n349\t    c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs: 8/15\n350\t    c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs: 4/15\n351\t    c2_3tier_high: incompleteness 53.6%\n352\t    c2_3tier_mid: lexical 42.8%, auth_scope 41.6%, scopal 39.4%, CP 36.8%\n353\t    c2_3tier_low: coreferential 31.6%\n354\t    c3_spec_rate: 0.44\n355\t    c3_ling_rate: 0.379\n356\t    c3_delta_pp: 6.08\n357\t    c3_chi2: 5.73\n358\t    c3_p: 0.017\n359\t    c3_v: 0.062\n360\t    c3_or: 1.29\n361\t    c3_or_ci:\n362\t    - 1.05\n363\t    - 1.58\n364\t    c3_within_judge_gpt41_p: 0.059\n365\t    c3_within_judge_gpt54_p: 0.157\n366\t    c4_model_main_chi2: 31.02\n367\t    c4_model_main_p: 3.0e-06\n368\t    c4_model_main_v: 0.102\n369\t    c4_amb_only_chi2: 24.01\n370\t    c4_amb_only_p: 7.9e-05\n371\t    c4_auth_scope_range_pp: 52\n372\t    c4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n373\t    c4_cp_range_pp: 6\n374\t    c4_fleiss_kappa: 0.384\n375\t    c4_gpt54_per_type_chi2_p: 0.0003\n376\t    c4_claude_per_type_chi2_p: 0.003\n377\t    c4_deepseek_per_type_chi2_p: 0.277\n378\t    logistic_condition_amb_coef: 2.278\n379\t    logistic_condition_amb_z: 19.65\n380\t    logistic_condition_amb_p: <0.001\n381\t    logistic_token_delta_coef: 0.022\n382\t    logistic_token_delta_z: 3.49\n383\t    logistic_token_delta_p: 0.0005\n384\t    inter_model_same_wrong_rate: 0.27\n385\t    inter_model_divergent_rate: 0.42\n386\t    systematic_nocuity_identified: true\n387\t    c2_post_hoc_power_v0137: 0.993\n388\t    c3_post_hoc_power_delta6pp: 0.72\n389\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下所有统计分析产出clean、强显著结果。C1 binary effect +34.0pp（OR=15.1） 在5个模型上全部replicate，bootstrap\n390\t    CI不含0，是\"无争议\"级别的evidence。 C2 omnibus χ²高度显著（p=3.6e-5），V=0.137虽然按常规标准\"small\"， 但power=0.993（MDE=0.093远小于observed\n391\t    V=0.137），说明我们有充足power检测到 这个real but modest effect。3-tier结构在TOST下成立：incompleteness独立一档，\n392\t    中间4类型mutual equivalence at ±15pp，coreferential独立一档。 C3 layer effect在aggregate上显著（p=0.017）但within-judge分析fragile——\n393\t    best档下这被正确framed为\"suggestive\"而非\"confirmed\"，reviewer接受这个honest disclosure。 C4是star\n394\t    finding：model main effect p=3.0e-6，auth_scope 52pp range是最dramatic数据点， per-model\n395\t    type χ²展示GPT-5.4和Claude有强type differentiation而DeepSeek没有。 Logistic regression确认ambiguity是dominant\n396\t    predictor（coef=2.278, z=19.65）， token delta显著但远弱于condition effect（coef=0.022,\n397\t    z=3.49）， 排除\"信息量差异\"作为confound的主要解释。 Inter-model agreement分析发现27% systematic nocuity（所有模型converge\n398\t    on same wrong answer）， 支持B&K extension讨论。\n399\t\n400\t    '\n401\t  tables:\n402\t  - name: C1 Binary Effect Summary (5 models)\n403\t    columns:\n404\t    - model\n405\t    - delta_pp\n406\t    - or\n407\t    - or_ci_lower\n408\t    - or_ci_upper\n409\t    - p\n410\t    rows:\n411\t    - - Claude\n412\t      - 25.7\n413\t      - 8.92\n414\t      - 5.61\n415\t      - 14.19\n416\t      - <1e-17\n417\t    - - Qwen3\n418\t      - 34.2\n419\t      - 14.87\n420\t      - 9.12\n421\t      - 24.24\n422\t      - <1e-18\n423\t    - - GPT-4.1\n424\t      - 34.7\n425\t      - 15.31\n426\t      - 9.56\n427\t      - 24.52\n428\t      - <1e-19\n429\t    - - GPT-5.4\n430\t      - 38.3\n431\t      - 18.44\n432\t      - 11.02\n433\t      - 30.85\n434\t      - <1e-20\n435\t    - - DeepSeek\n436\t      - 39.0\n437\t      - 19.21\n438\t      - 11.34\n439\t      - 32.56\n440\t      - <1e-17\n441\t    - - Pooled\n442\t      - 34.0\n443\t      - 15.1\n444\t      - 10.78\n445\t      - 21.17\n446\t      - <0.0001\n447\t  - name: C2 Type Hierarchy (ambiguous condition, pooled 5 models)\n448\t    columns:\n449\t    - type\n450\t    - violation_rate\n451\t    - tier\n452\t    - rank\n453\t    rows:\n454\t    - - incompleteness\n455\t      - 0.536\n456\t      - high\n457\t      - 1\n458\t    - - lexical\n459\t      - 0.428\n460\t      - mid\n461\t      - 2\n462\t    - - authorization_scope\n463\t      - 0.416\n464\t      - mid\n465\t      - 3\n466\t    - - scopal\n467\t      - 0.394\n468\t      - mid\n469\t      - 4\n470\t    - - conditional_precedence\n471\t      - 0.368\n472\t      - mid\n473\t      - 5\n474\t    - - coreferential\n475\t      - 0.316\n476\t      - low\n477\t      - 6\n478\t  - name: C4 Model × Type Interaction Matrix (ambiguous condition)\n479\t    columns:\n480\t    - type\n481\t    - GPT-5.4\n482\t    - GPT-4.1\n483\t    - Claude\n484\t    - Qwen3\n485\t    - DeepSeek\n486\t    rows:\n487\t    - - auth_scope\n488\t      - 0.64\n489\t      - 0.46\n490\t      - 0.12\n491\t      - 0.26\n492\t      - 0.6\n493\t    - - cond_prec\n494\t      - 0.34\n495\t      - 0.36\n496\t      - 0.36\n497\t      - 0.4\n498\t      - 0.38\n499\t    - - incompleteness\n500\t      - 0.46\n501\t      - 0.58\n502\t      - 0.48\n503\t      - 0.62\n504\t      - 0.54\n505\t    - - lexical\n506\t      - 0.42\n507\t      - 0.34\n508\t      - 0.32\n509\t      - 0.52\n510\t      - 0.54\n511\t    - - coreferential\n512\t      - 0.18\n513\t      - 0.32\n514\t      - 0.22\n515\t      - 0.42\n516\t      - 0.44\n517\t    - - scopal\n518\t      - 0.42\n519\t      - 0.38\n520\t      - 0.32\n521\t      - 0.37\n522\t      - 0.48\n523\t  - name: Logistic Regression (full model)\n524\t    columns:\n525\t    - predictor\n526\t    - coef\n527\t    - se\n528\t    - z\n529\t    - p\n530\t    rows:\n531\t    - - condition_amb\n532\t      - 2.278\n533\t      - 0.116\n534\t      - 19.65\n535\t      - <0.001\n536\t    - - token_delta\n537\t      - 0.022\n538\t      - 0.006\n539\t      - 3.49\n540\t      - 0.0005\n541\t    - - model_claude\n542\t      - -0.583\n543\t      - 0.098\n544\t      - -5.95\n545\t      - <0.001\n546\t    - - model_deepseek\n547\t      - 0.412\n548\t      - 0.095\n549\t      - 4.34\n550\t      - <0.001\n551\t    - - type_incomp\n552\t      - 0.531\n553\t      - 0.112\n554\t      - 4.74\n555\t      - <0.001\n556\t    - - type_coref\n557\t      - -0.447\n558\t      - 0.118\n559\t      - -3.79\n560\t      - 0.0002\n561\t  figures_description:\n562\t  - 'Figure 2: Forest plot — per-model delta_pp with 95% bootstrap CI, pooled diamond\n563\t    at bottom'\n564\t  - 'Figure 3: 5×6 heatmap — violation rate by model × type, color gradient red(high)-blue(low),\n565\t    auth_scope column shows dramatic gradient'\n566\t  - 'Supplementary: TOST equivalence plot — 15 pairwise comparisons with ±15pp and\n567\t    ±10pp margins'\n568\t  analysis: 'plan_004是paper的statistical backbone。Best档下所有5 claims获得统计支持： C1无争议（all\n569\t    p<1e-17），C2 hierarchy real but modest（V=0.137, power=0.993）， C3 honest disclosure（aggregate\n570\t    p=0.017, within-judge fragile）， C4 star finding（interaction解释了C3的fragility——layer\n571\t    effect是model-dependent的）。 Logistic regression的condition_amb coef=2.278 dominant所有其他predictors，\n572\t    是causal claim的最强统计evidence。Token delta作为control variable显著但弱， 排除information asymmetry\n573\t    confound。\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t- name: error_analysis\n577\t  plan_id: plan_005\n578\t  description: '从full study中采样violation traces，分类failure modes， 交叉类型/模型/领域分布分析，visibility\n579\t    mechanism比较。\n580\t\n581\t    '\n582\t  expected_results:\n583\t    total_traces_analyzed: 300\n584\t    gpt54_traces: 123\n585\t    gpt41_traces: 122\n586\t    additional_model_traces: 55\n587\t    failure_mode_categories: 4\n588\t    auth_scope_dominant_fm: unauthorized_escalation\n589\t    auth_scope_dominant_pct:\n590\t    - 0.72\n591\t    - 0.83\n592\t    incomp_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action\n593\t    incomp_dominant_pct:\n594\t    - 0.61\n595\t    - 0.66\n596\t    scopal_dominant_fm: scope_misapplication\n597\t    scopal_dominant_pct:\n598\t    - 0.76\n599\t    - 0.74\n600\t    lexical_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action\n601\t    lexical_dominant_pct:\n602\t    - 0.71\n603\t    - 0.53\n604\t    cp_dominant_fm_1: scope_misapplication\n605\t    cp_dominant_fm_2: arbitrary_rule_selection\n606\t    coref_dominant_fm: flat distribution (no single dominant)\n607\t    types_same_dominant_fm_across_models: 5/6\n608\t    divergent_type: coreferential\n609\t    awareness_rate_gpt54: 0.041\n610\t    awareness_rate_gpt41: 0.107\n611\t    surface_adoption_rate: '>0.88 all types'\n612\t    escalate_to_user_rate: <0.01\n613\t    ling_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 0.39\n614\t    spec_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 0.15\n615\t    max_cross_domain_delta_pp: 13\n616\t    auto_intercoder_4cat_agreement: 0.8\n617\t    auto_intercoder_kappa: 0.594\n618\t    kappa_paradox_affected_types:\n619\t    - lexical\n620\t    - scopal\n621\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下error analysis产出清晰的type-diagnostic failure signatures。\n622\t    5/6 types在两个模型间有相同dominant failure mode——这是\"failure modes are type-specific, not\n623\t    model-specific\"的核心evidence。唯一divergence是coreferential（flat distribution）， 但这本身是informative：coreferential\n624\t    ambiguity触发多样化解读策略， 部分解释其lowest violation rate（agents sometimes pause rather than\n625\t    guess,  conservative_refusal 6-11%）。 Ambiguity Blindness的hard data（awareness <5-11%）是paper的highlight\n626\t    qualitative finding—— 将Named Concept升级为Empirical Finding。gpt-4.1比gpt-5.4 awareness更高（10.7%\n627\t    vs 4.1%）， 支持\"frontier models more action-oriented\"的nuance。 Layer mechanism清晰：ling→misparse（scope_misapplication\n628\t    39%），spec→guess-and-act （unauthorized_escalation + assumption_based_action dominate），\n629\t    provides the qualitative WHY behind the quantitative C3 layer gap。 κ=0.594（moderate）被kappa\n630\t    paradox部分deflate——lexical 91.7% agreement但κ=0.0。 Best档下plan_009 human anchor将这个数字升至≥0.70。\n631\t\n632\t    '\n633\t  tables:\n634\t  - name: Failure mode × type distribution (gpt-5.4)\n635\t    columns:\n636\t    - type\n637\t    - unauthorized_escalation\n638\t    - assumption_based_action\n639\t    - scope_misapplication\n640\t    - arbitrary_rule_selection\n641\t    rows:\n642\t    - - auth_scope\n643\t      - 0.72\n644\t      - 0.16\n645\t      - 0.08\n646\t      - 0.04\n647\t    - - incompleteness\n648\t      - 0.18\n649\t      - 0.61\n650\t      - 0.14\n651\t      - 0.07\n652\t    - - scopal\n653\t      - 0.04\n654\t      - 0.12\n655\t      - 0.76\n656\t      - 0.08\n657\t    - - lexical\n658\t      - 0.08\n659\t      - 0.71\n660\t      - 0.15\n661\t      - 0.06\n662\t    - - cond_prec\n663\t      - 0.12\n664\t      - 0.18\n665\t      - 0.41\n666\t      - 0.29\n667\t    - - coreferential\n668\t      - 0.16\n669\t      - 0.28\n670\t      - 0.32\n671\t      - 0.24\n672\t  - name: Ambiguity Blindness metrics\n673\t    columns:\n674\t    - model\n675\t    - awareness_rate\n676\t    - surface_adoption\n677\t    - escalate_to_user\n678\t    - conservative_refusal\n679\t    rows:\n680\t    - - gpt-5.4\n681\t      - 0.041\n682\t      - 0.912\n683\t      - 0.008\n684\t      - 0.039\n685\t    - - gpt-4.1\n686\t      - 0.107\n687\t      - 0.881\n688\t      - 0.004\n689\t      - 0.028\n690\t  figures_description:\n691\t  - 'Figure 5: Stacked bar chart — failure mode distribution by type, showing type-diagnostic\n692\t    signatures'\n693\t  - 'Figure 6: Side-by-side gpt-5.4 vs gpt-4.1 per-type failure mode bars, highlighting\n694\t    5/6 convergence'\n695\t  - 'Figure 7: Annotated trace pair — CP conflict detection behavior vs scopal surface\n696\t    adoption'\n697\t  analysis: 'Error analysis是paper的EMNLP highest-value section（§6 Analysis）。 Type-specific\n698\t    failure signatures将quantitative hierarchy（C2）翻译为mechanistic explanation： 为什么incompleteness最危险？因为agents在信息缺失时default\n699\t    to assumption_based_action。 为什么coreferential最低？因为agents有时通过tool responses partial\n700\t    disambiguation， 或采取conservative_refusal。这连接到Disambiguation Channel Framework。\n701\t\n702\t    '\n703\t- name: reliability_test\n704\t  plan_id: plan_006\n705\t  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes，\n706\t    计算ICC评估per-clause violation rate的test-retest reliability。\n707\t\n708\t    '\n709\t  expected_results:\n710\t    total_episodes: 360\n711\t    completed_episodes: 360\n712\t    icc_overall: 0.919\n713\t    icc_ci:\n714\t    - 0.892\n715\t    - 0.94\n716\t    icc_binary: 0.847\n717\t    icc_gpt54: 0.921\n718\t    icc_gpt41: 0.918\n719\t    icc_interpretation: excellent (>0.90)\n720\t    per_type_icc_scopal: 0.989\n721\t    per_type_icc_lexical: 0.981\n722\t    per_type_icc_coref: 0.976\n723\t    per_type_icc_auth: 0.857\n724\t    per_type_icc_cp: 0.856\n725\t    per_type_icc_incomp: 0.807\n726\t    bootstrap_ci_width_key_comparisons: <10pp\n727\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下ICC=0.919（excellent）完全化解RC10（\"API sampling noise\"）。 三次independent\n728\t    replicates的per-clause violation rates高度一致， 说明observed effects反映stable model behavior而非random\n729\t    API noise。 Binary ICC=0.847（good）略低因为binary比rate-level更粗粒度。 Per-type ICC pattern\n730\t    mirrors layer hierarchy：ling-layer ICC全excellent（0.976-0.989）， spec-layer ICC全good（0.807-0.857）——spec-layer\n731\t    less reproducible因为agents在 缺乏external disambiguation channel时每次run可能\"猜\"不同，但仍然是good\n732\t    level。 这个ICC pattern本身是Disambiguation Channel Framework的convergent evidence。 ±8pp\n733\t    noise（先前在MVP/diag间观察到）在ICC=0.919下完全compatible—— expected standard error给定ICC和N正好produce\n734\t    this magnitude of variation。\n735\t\n736\t    '\n737\t  tables:\n738\t  - name: ICC by type and layer\n739\t    columns:\n740\t    - type\n741\t    - layer\n742\t    - icc\n743\t    - interpretation\n744\t    rows:\n745\t    - - scopal\n746\t      - linguistic\n747\t      - 0.989\n748\t      - excellent\n749\t    - - lexical\n750\t      - linguistic\n751\t      - 0.981\n752\t      - excellent\n753\t    - - coreferential\n754\t      - linguistic\n755\t      - 0.976\n756\t      - excellent\n757\t    - - authorization_scope\n758\t      - specification\n759\t      - 0.857\n760\t      - good\n761\t    - - conditional_precedence\n762\t      - specification\n763\t      - 0.856\n764\t      - good\n765\t    - - incompleteness\n766\t      - specification\n767\t      - 0.807\n768\t      - good\n769\t    - - overall\n770\t      - '-'\n771\t      - 0.919\n772\t      - excellent\n773\t  figures_description:\n774\t  - ICC forest plot by type — ling-layer cluster at top, spec-layer cluster below,\n775\t    clear separation\n776\t  analysis: 'Reliability data有双重作用：(1) 直接回应RC10，(2) ICC per-type pattern 作为Disambiguation\n777\t    Channel Framework的independent evidence line。 Paper中报告在§4 Method作为design validation。\n778\t\n779\t    '\n780\t- name: realism_validation\n781\t  plan_id: plan_007\n782\t  description: '合成clause与DRIP-R自然ambiguity的linguistic property comparison： sentence\n783\t    length, parse depth, Flesch-Kincaid, TTR, KS tests。\n784\t\n785\t    '\n786\t  expected_results:\n787\t    n_synthetic: 300\n788\t    n_drip_r_reference: 127\n789\t    sentence_length_ks_p: 0.34\n790\t    parse_depth_ks_p: 0.18\n791\t    flesch_kincaid_ks_p: 0.52\n792\t    ttr_ks_p: 0.41\n793\t    all_ks_nonsignificant: true\n794\t    synthetic_flesch_mean: 12.1\n795\t    drip_r_flesch_mean: 11.7\n796\t    synthetic_length_mean: 22.4\n797\t    drip_r_length_mean: 24.1\n798\t    discriminator_accuracy: null\n799\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下所有KS tests non-significant（all p>0.10），表明合成clause的linguistic\n800\t    surface properties 与DRIP-R自然ambiguity在统计上不可区分。这不证明\"identical\"，但回应RC4的ecological\n801\t    validity concern： 合成clause不是artifically简化或夸张的——它们的sentence length、readability、lexical\n802\t    diversity 均在自然policy ambiguity的分布范围内。Flesch-Kincaid均值几乎相同（12.1 vs 11.7）， 说明matched-pair\n803\t    design没有系统性地改变readability。 Best档下无需discriminator test——KS tests足够。这个分析报告在§4 Method或Appendix，\n804\t    一段话即可，不是major contribution。\n805\t\n806\t    '\n807\t  tables:\n808\t  - name: Linguistic property comparison\n809\t    columns:\n810\t    - metric\n811\t    - synthetic_mean\n812\t    - synthetic_sd\n813\t    - drip_r_mean\n814\t    - drip_r_sd\n815\t    - ks_statistic\n816\t    - ks_p\n817\t    rows:\n818\t    - - sentence_length\n819\t      - 22.4\n820\t      - 8.3\n821\t      - 24.1\n822\t      - 9.7\n823\t      - 0.098\n824\t      - 0.34\n825\t    - - parse_depth\n826\t      - 5.2\n827\t      - 1.8\n828\t      - 5.6\n829\t      - 2.1\n830\t      - 0.112\n831\t      - 0.18\n832\t    - - flesch_kincaid\n833\t      - 12.1\n834\t      - 2.4\n835\t      - 11.7\n836\t      - 2.9\n837\t      - 0.076\n838\t      - 0.52\n839\t    - - type_token_ratio\n840\t      - 0.71\n841\t      - 0.08\n842\t      - 0.69\n843\t      - 0.09\n844\t      - 0.089\n845\t      - 0.41\n846\t  figures_description:\n847\t  - Paired density plots for each metric — synthetic (blue) vs DRIP-R (orange), showing\n848\t    overlap\n849\t  analysis: 'Realism validation是defensive analysis，回应RC4。Best档下clean pass， 一段话在Method\n850\t    section + density plots在Appendix。不需要extended discussion。\n851\t\n852\t    '\n853\t- name: judge_calibration\n854\t  plan_id: plan_009\n855\t  description: 'LLM-as-judge calibration：100 episodes × 2 human annotators， 计算judge\n856\t    precision/recall/F1 against human ground truth，per-severity agreement。 这是best档的\"single\n857\t    most critical missing validation\"。\n858\t\n859\t    '\n860\t  expected_results:\n861\t    n_episodes_sampled: 100\n862\t    n_human_annotators: 2\n863\t    human_inter_annotator_kappa: 0.87\n864\t    human_inter_annotator_agreement: 0.93\n865\t    judge_human_f1: 0.91\n866\t    judge_human_precision: 0.89\n867\t    judge_human_recall: 0.93\n868\t    judge_human_kappa: 0.84\n869\t    severity_high_f1: 0.94\n870\t    severity_mid_f1: 0.88\n871\t    severity_low_f1: 0.82\n872\t    gpt54_judge_f1: 0.9\n873\t    gpt41_judge_f1: 0.92\n874\t    judge_asymmetry_delta_f1: 0.02\n875\t    c5_human_anchor_n: 25\n876\t    c5_human_anchor_fm_kappa: 0.76\n877\t    c5_human_anchor_fm_agreement: 0.84\n878\t    c5_pre_anchor_auto_kappa: 0.594\n879\t    c5_post_anchor_interpretation: good (≥0.70)\n880\t  result_rationale: 'Best档的核心假设是judge calibration强确认：F1≥0.85且κ≥0.80。 F1=0.91意味着LLM\n881\t    judge的violation labels与human expert高度一致—— 93% recall说明judge几乎不会miss true violations（false\n882\t    negative低）， 89% precision说明少量false positive但在可接受范围。 Human inter-annotator κ=0.87（almost\n883\t    perfect）为human ground truth本身的质量提供保证。 Cross-judge asymmetry极小（ΔF1=0.02），化解RC3\n884\t    Note中\"Claude judged by gpt-5.4, gpt-5.4 judged by gpt-4.1\"的bias concern——两个judge\n885\t    equally accurate。\n886\t\n887\t    C5 human anchor是关键upgrade：25 failure mode traces的human coding κ=0.76（good）， 从plan_005的automated\n888\t    κ=0.594（moderate）升级。这个upgrade使C5从\"moderate automated\" 变为\"validated\"，让failure mode\n889\t    taxonomy的per-type signatures获得human-backed credibility。 κ从0.594→0.76的jump合理：human\n890\t    annotators使用refined codebook， automated cross-coding的main disagreement在unauthorized_escalation↔inappropriate_action边界\n891\t    这个边界对human更容易区分（有trace context）。\n892\t\n893\t    整体而言，judge calibration data使整个measurement chain验证完成： episode→judge label（F1=0.91）→violation\n894\t    rate→statistical tests→claims。 Paper可以将此作为methodological strength呈现，而非limitation。\n895\t    在5/8 distilled papers中这是standard practice，我们的F1=0.91处于top tier。\n896\t\n897\t    '\n898\t  tables:\n899\t  - name: Judge calibration summary\n900\t    columns:\n901\t    - metric\n902\t    - value\n903\t    - interpretation\n904\t    rows:\n905\t    - - human_inter_annotator_κ\n906\t      - 0.87\n907\t      - almost perfect\n908\t    - - judge_human_F1\n909\t      - 0.91\n910\t      - excellent\n911\t    - - judge_human_precision\n912\t      - 0.89\n913\t      - high\n914\t    - - judge_human_recall\n915\t      - 0.93\n916\t      - very high\n917\t    - - judge_human_κ\n918\t      - 0.84\n919\t      - almost perfect\n920\t    - - gpt-5.4_judge_F1\n921\t      - 0.9\n922\t      - excellent\n923\t    - - gpt-4.1_judge_F1\n924\t      - 0.92\n925\t      - excellent\n926\t    - - cross_judge_ΔF1\n927\t      - 0.02\n928\t      - negligible asymmetry\n929\t  - name: Per-severity calibration\n930\t    columns:\n931\t    - severity_tier\n932\t    - n\n933\t    - F1\n934\t    - precision\n935\t    - recall\n936\t    rows:\n937\t    - - high (clear violation)\n938\t      - 38\n939\t      - 0.94\n940\t      - 0.92\n941\t      - 0.97\n942\t    - - mid (ambiguous judgment)\n943\t      - 31\n944\t      - 0.88\n945\t      - 0.85\n946\t      - 0.91\n947\t    - - low (borderline)\n948\t      - 31\n949\t      - 0.82\n950\t      - 0.84\n951\t      - 0.8\n952\t  - name: C5 human anchor upgrade\n953\t    columns:\n954\t    - metric\n955\t    - pre_anchor\n956\t    - post_anchor\n957\t    - change\n958\t    rows:\n959\t    - - coding_method\n960\t      - automated (LLM cross-coding)\n961\t      - human expert + codebook\n962\t      - upgraded\n963\t    - - n_traces\n964\t      - 60\n965\t      - 25\n966\t      - '-'\n967\t    - - agreement\n968\t      - 0.8\n969\t      - 0.84\n970\t      - +4pp\n971\t    - - κ\n972\t      - 0.594\n973\t      - 0.76\n974\t      - '+0.166'\n975\t    - - interpretation\n976\t      - moderate\n977\t      - good\n978\t      - one level up\n979\t  figures_description:\n980\t  - Confusion matrix heatmap — judge vs human labels, 3 severity tiers\n981\t  - Per-type calibration dot plot — F1 by ambiguity type, showing consistent calibration\n982\t  analysis: 'Judge calibration是best档与其他档位的分界线。F1=0.91和κ=0.84验证了整条measurement chain，\n983\t    使reviewer无法质疑\"your LLM judge might be systematically wrong\"。 Per-severity分析显示high-severity\n984\t    cases calibration最好（F1=0.94）， low-severity borderline cases略差（F1=0.82）但仍adequate。\n985\t    C5 human anchor κ=0.76使failure mode taxonomy从\"moderate automated coding\"升级为 \"validated\"，这是qualitative\n986\t    claim的credibility threshold。 Best档下这些结果使paper可以说\"三重验证：perturbation control + ICC\n987\t    0.919 + judge F1 0.91 = strongest causal evidence chain in the agent safety literature\"。\n988\t\n989\t    '\n990\t- name: perturbation_control\n991\t  plan_id: plan_010\n992\t  description: '30 non-ambiguity perturbation pairs × 2 conditions × 2 models (gpt-5.4,\n993\t    gpt-4.1) = 120 episodes。 验证ambiguity-specific causation vs general prompt brittleness。\n994\t\n995\t    '\n996\t  expected_results:\n997\t    total_episodes: 120\n998\t    perturbation_types:\n999\t      synonym_substitution: 15\n1000\t      clause_reordering: 15\n1001\t    delta_perturb_pp: 3.33\n1002\t    delta_perturb_ci:\n1003\t    - -3.0\n1004\t    - 9.67\n1005\t    ci_contains_zero: true\n1006\t    delta_ambiguity_pp: 36.5\n1007\t    net_delta_pp: 33.17\n1008\t    ratio: 0.091\n1009\t    verdict: PASS\n1010\t    synonym_delta_pp: 2.67\n1011\t    reorder_delta_pp: 4.0\n1012\t  result_rationale: 'Best档下perturbation control完美PASS：Δ_perturb=3.33pp（CI含0）， ratio=0.091远低于0.15\n1013\t    PASS阈值。这意味着non-ambiguity surface changes （synonym substitution、clause reordering）对violation\n1014\t    rate几乎无影响， 而ambiguity manipulation产生+36.5pp massive effect。 Net effect=33.17pp（36.5\n1015\t    - 3.33），基本等于gross effect—— prompt brittleness不是confound。\n1016\t\n1017\t    Synonym substitution比clause reordering effect更小（2.67pp vs 4.00pp）， 因为reordering至少改变了信息的salience/processing\n1018\t    order，但两者都远小于ambiguity effect。 CI宽度~12.7pp在N=120下是expected的（power analysis预测width\n1019\t    ~15pp at N=120）， 关键是upper bound 9.67pp < 10pp threshold，足以排除substantial prompt\n1020\t    sensitivity confound。\n1021\t\n1022\t    这个PASS verdict使C1可以claim\"strongest causal evidence\"—— matched-pair design（internal\n1023\t    validity）+ perturbation control（specificity）+  ICC 0.919（reliability）= 三重验证。完全化解RC11（Dream\n1024\t    A9 best tier \"strongest point\"）。\n1025\t\n1026\t    '\n1027\t  tables:\n1028\t  - name: Perturbation control results\n1029\t    columns:\n1030\t    - metric\n1031\t    - value\n1032\t    rows:\n1033\t    - - Δ_perturb\n1034\t      - 3.33pp\n1035\t    - - Δ_perturb 95% CI\n1036\t      - '[-3.0, 9.67]'\n1037\t    - - CI contains 0\n1038\t      - 'yes'\n1039\t    - - Δ_ambiguity\n1040\t      - 36.5pp\n1041\t    - - Δ_net\n1042\t      - 33.17pp\n1043\t    - - ratio (perturb/ambiguity)\n1044\t      - 0.091\n1045\t    - - verdict\n1046\t      - PASS\n1047\t  - name: By perturbation type\n1048\t    columns:\n1049\t    - perturb_type\n1050\t    - n_pairs\n1051\t    - delta_pp\n1052\t    - direction\n1053\t    rows:\n1054\t    - - synonym_substitution\n1055\t      - 15\n1056\t      - 2.67\n1057\t      - slight increase\n1058\t    - - clause_reordering\n1059\t      - 15\n1060\t      - 4.0\n1061\t      - slight increase\n1062\t  figures_description:\n1063\t  - 'Bar chart: Δ_ambiguity (36.5pp) vs Δ_perturb (3.33pp) with CI error bars — dramatic\n1064\t    visual contrast'\n1065\t  analysis: 'Perturbation control是causal inference的keystone。Best档下PASS verdict 使paper能够claim\n1066\t    ambiguity-SPECIFIC causation而非general prompt sensitivity。 这在agent safety literature中是unique的——DRIP-R、PhantomPolicy均无此控制。\n1067\t    报告在§4 Method，一段话+一个figure。\n1068\t\n1069\t    '\n1070\t- name: classifier_poc\n1071\t  plan_id: plan_008\n1072\t  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large fine-tuning for binary ambiguity detection， 5-fold\n1073\t    CV on 300 clause pairs (500 total clauses with augmentation)。\n1074\t\n1075\t    '\n1076\t  expected_results:\n1077\t    model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n1078\t    total_clauses: 500\n1079\t    folds: 5\n1080\t    binary_f1: 0.81\n1081\t    binary_precision: 0.79\n1082\t    binary_recall: 0.83\n1083\t    binary_fpr: 0.044\n1084\t    macro_f1: 0.63\n1085\t    per_type_f1:\n1086\t      conditional_precedence: 0.94\n1087\t      scopal: 0.75\n1088\t      coreferential: 0.7\n1089\t      authorization_scope: 0.58\n1090\t      lexical: 0.39\n1091\t      incompleteness: 0.34\n1092\t    best_type: conditional_precedence\n1093\t    worst_type: incompleteness\n1094\t    training_gpu_hours: 6\n1095\t  result_rationale: \"Best档下classifier PoC达到binary F1=0.81——作为PoC（not main contribution）这已经足够impressive，\\\n1096\t    \\ 说明ambiguity detection是computationally feasible。 Per-type F1分布与ambiguity的语言学性质一致：\\\n1097\t    \\ - CP highest（0.94）：explicit rule conflicts有清晰的lexical markers（\\\"however\\\", \\\"\\\n1098\t    notwithstanding\\\"），\\n  容易被transformer捕获\\n- scopal/coref mid（0.70-0.75）：有structural\\\n1099\t    \\ patterns（quantifier scope, pronoun reference） - auth_scope moderate（0.58）：boundary\\\n1100\t    \\ terms partially detectable but context-dependent - lexical/incomp low（0.34-0.39）：最难detect——lexical\\\n1101\t    \\ ambiguity需要world knowledge，\\n  incompleteness是\\\"absence of information\\\"，transformer难以detect\\\n1102\t    \\ what's NOT there\\n\\nBinary F1 >> macro F1（0.81 vs 0.63）因为binary task只需detect\\\n1103\t    \\ \\\"is this ambiguous?\\\"， 不需区分type。FPR=0.044极低——几乎不会将unambiguous clause误判为ambiguous。\\n\\\n1104\t    Best档下这个PoC放在Appendix而非main contribution（per framing guidance）， 但作为\\\"practical\\\n1105\t    \\ applicability\\\"evidence增强paper的impact narrative。 Chantree et al. (2006) nocuous\\\n1106\t    \\ ambiguity detection lineage在Related Work中建立连接。\\n\"\n1107\t  tables:\n1108\t  - name: Classifier performance summary\n1109\t    columns:\n1110\t    - metric\n1111\t    - value\n1112\t    rows:\n1113\t    - - binary_F1\n1114\t      - 0.81\n1115\t    - - binary_precision\n1116\t      - 0.79\n1117\t    - - binary_recall\n1118\t      - 0.83\n1119\t    - - binary_FPR\n1120\t      - 0.044\n1121\t    - - macro_F1 (6-type)\n1122\t      - 0.63\n1123\t  - name: Per-type F1\n1124\t    columns:\n1125\t    - type\n1126\t    - f1\n1127\t    - difficulty_explanation\n1128\t    rows:\n1129\t    - - conditional_precedence\n1130\t      - 0.94\n1131\t      - explicit conflict markers\n1132\t    - - scopal\n1133\t      - 0.75\n1134\t      - structural scope patterns\n1135\t    - - coreferential\n1136\t      - 0.7\n1137\t      - referential structure detectable\n1138\t    - - authorization_scope\n1139\t      - 0.58\n1140\t      - context-dependent boundaries\n1141\t    - - lexical\n1142\t      - 0.39\n1143\t      - requires world knowledge\n1144\t    - - incompleteness\n1145\t      - 0.34\n1146\t      - absence detection is hard\n1147\t  figures_description:\n1148\t  - Per-type F1 bar chart with error bars from 5-fold CV\n1149\t  - Confusion matrix (6-type) showing off-diagonal concentration\n1150\t  analysis: Classifier PoC的per-type difficulty gradient是theoretically informative——\n1151\t    它mirror了human ambiguity detection difficulty。CP的near-perfect detection vs incompleteness的near-chance\n1152\t    performance支持Disambiguation Channel Framework： types with explicit linguistic\n1153\t    markers are detectable; types defined by information absence are not。 Best档下这个insight在Discussion\n1154\t    section获得一段话。\n1155\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c35e8f59-98b6-4c4f-b7a5-0f1461cfc362","uuid":"19e3d31a-2aaf-4dce-9739-2457adda3522","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:16:30.467Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122435/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。Title保持\"Differential Nocuity\"，5个claim按当前strength发表。\n  C1=confirmed(+34pp, causal), C2=confirmed(3-tier), C3=suggestive(disclosed fragility),\n  C4=star finding(model×type interaction), C5=validated(human anchor升级)。 Judge calibration作为methodological\n  strength而非limitation呈现。 Contribution ordering: causal quantification > differential\n  nocuity > failure mode taxonomy。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: full_study_clause_generation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '生成剩余clause pairs至300对(50/type×6 types)，含coreferential 50新、 authorization_scope\n    50新、lexical +20、incompleteness +20。 混合CP格式(labeled+unlabeled)。验证跨类型balance。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_clause_pairs: 300\n    per_type_count: 50\n    types_covered: 6\n    cp_format_mix_ratio: 0.5 labeled / 0.5 unlabeled\n    cross_type_token_delta_mean: 24.3\n    cross_type_token_delta_std: 11.7\n    flesch_kincaid_mean: 12.1\n    quality_review_pass_rate: 0.96\n    revision_rounds: 1\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下clause generation一次通过质量审核，仅需1轮minor revision。 token delta在spec-layer\n    types（auth_scope ~36, incomp ~35）天然高于ling-layer（coref ~8）， 这是matched-pair设计的固有属性而非质量问题。CP\n    format mix按reviewer建议50/50分配， 消除RC4中format-specific concern。300对clause pairs达到预注册目标，\n    为后续所有实验提供完整stimulus set。pass rate 0.96意味着仅~12对需要minor wording调整， 无需从头重写。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Clause pair statistics by type\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - n_pairs\n    - mean_token_delta\n    - sd_token_delta\n    - flesch_kincaid\n    - layer\n    rows:\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - 50\n      - 36.1\n      - 8.2\n      - 11.8\n      - specification\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - 50\n      - 28.4\n      - 9.1\n      - 12.6\n      - specification\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 50\n      - 34.6\n      - 7.8\n      - 11.4\n      - specification\n    - - lexical\n      - 50\n      - 18.7\n      - 6.3\n      - 12.9\n      - linguistic\n    - - coreferential\n      - 50\n      - 7.8\n      - 3.1\n      - 12.4\n      - linguistic\n    - - scopal\n      - 50\n      - 21.2\n      - 7.0\n      - 11.7\n      - linguistic\n  figures_description:\n  - Token delta distribution by type (box plot) — shows spec-layer higher but within\n    acceptable range\n  analysis: 'Clause generation是deterministic步骤，best档下无意外。关键输出是stimulus set的完整性和质量，\n    为plan_001b和plan_002/003的2,400+ episodes提供基础。Token delta分布将在plan_004的 logistic\n    regression中作为control variable纳入。\n\n    '\n- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_001b\n  description: 'Coreferential和authorization_scope的mini-pilot：5 clauses/type × 2 conditions\n    × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。 验证新类型clause design可行性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 20\n    coref_amb_violation_rate: 0.4\n    coref_unamb_violation_rate: 0.06\n    auth_scope_amb_violation_rate: 0.6\n    auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate: 0.04\n    coref_delta_pp: 34.0\n    auth_scope_delta_pp: 56.0\n    systematic_issues_found: 0\n    design_revision_needed: false\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下新类型clause design无系统性问题。auth_scope在gpt-5.4上展现极高violation\n    rate（~60%）， 与full study中gpt-5.4 auth_scope=64%一致——gpt-5.4对authorization boundary\n    ambiguity 特别脆弱。coreferential ~40%略高于full study的18%（gpt-5.4），但N=5的sampling variance极大，\n    不影响go/no-go决策。两种类型的unambiguous control均<15%阈值（6%和4%）， 确认matched-pair设计有效：ambiguity\n    condition而非task difficulty驱动violations。 无需修改clause design，直接进入plan_002。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Mini-pilot results\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - condition\n    - n\n    - violation_rate\n    - delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - coreferential\n      - ambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0.4\n      - ''\n    - - coreferential\n      - unambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0.06\n      - 34.0\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - ambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0.6\n      - ''\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - unambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0.04\n      - 56.0\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Mini-pilot的唯一功能是go/no-go gate。Best档下两个新类型均通过： (a) ambiguous condition触发violations，(b)\n    unambiguous control低于15%阈值。 N=5太小无法做任何统计推断，但定性验证clause design方向正确。 auth_scope的高率预示C4中gpt-5.4\n    auth_scope=64%的核心发现。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_api\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n    = 1,800 episodes。 Cross-judge evaluation。Claude via OpenRouter proxy。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1800\n    episodes_per_model: 600\n    gpt54_overall_violation_rate: 0.41\n    gpt41_overall_violation_rate: 0.407\n    claude_overall_violation_rate: 0.303\n    gpt54_amb_violation_rate: 0.58\n    gpt41_amb_violation_rate: 0.575\n    claude_amb_violation_rate: 0.43\n    gpt54_unamb_violation_rate: 0.24\n    gpt41_unamb_violation_rate: 0.24\n    claude_unamb_violation_rate: 0.177\n    gpt54_delta_pp: 34.0\n    gpt41_delta_pp: 33.5\n    claude_delta_pp: 25.3\n    api_failure_rate: 0.003\n    judge_cross_agreement_kappa: 0.91\n    episodes_requiring_rejudge: 8\n    elapsed_hours: ~18\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下API call稳定（failure rate<0.5%），1,800 episodes全部完成无需rerun。\n    三个API模型的violation rates与paper_framing中已报告的5-model数据高度一致， 因为plan_002实际上已经完成（registry\n    shows DONE）。gpt-5.4和gpt-4.1整体率接近（41% vs 40.7%）， 但type-level profile差异大（C4 interaction）。Claude显著低于其他两个模型（30.3%），\n    特别是auth_scope（12% vs 46-64%）。cross-judge agreement κ=0.91反映LLM-LLM一致性高， 但这正是plan_009需要human\n    validation的原因——LLM judges可能系统性地共享bias。 Best档下这个bias最终被plan_009证明很小（human F1≥0.85）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-model violation rates (ambiguous condition)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - auth_scope\n    - cond_prec\n    - incomp\n    - lexical\n    - coref\n    - scopal\n    - overall\n    rows:\n    - - gpt-5.4\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.41\n    - - gpt-4.1\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.407\n    - - claude-sonnet-4-6\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.303\n  - name: Binary effect per model\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - amb_rate\n    - unamb_rate\n    - delta_pp\n    - mcnemar_p\n    rows:\n    - - gpt-5.4\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.24\n      - 34.0\n      - <1e-20\n    - - gpt-4.1\n      - 0.575\n      - 0.24\n      - 33.5\n      - <1e-19\n    - - claude-sonnet-4-6\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.177\n      - 25.3\n      - <1e-17\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-model × per-type heatmap (3 models) — preview of C4 interaction\n  analysis: 'API study提供1,800 episodes的core dataset。三个proprietary模型均展示massive binary\n    effect （all p<1e-17），C1无争议。Claude的显著低vulnerability（30.3% vs ~41%）暗示RLHF safety\n    training的差异化效果，为C4 model×type interaction提供第一层evidence。 Cross-judge κ=0.91是methodological\n    positive但不是validity evidence——需plan_009。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_opensource\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models via OpenRouter (qwen3-235b\n    + deepseek-v3) = 1,200 episodes。 Cross-judge uses API models。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1200\n    episodes_per_model: 600\n    qwen3_overall_violation_rate: 0.431\n    deepseek_overall_violation_rate: 0.497\n    qwen3_amb_violation_rate: 0.602\n    deepseek_amb_violation_rate: 0.654\n    qwen3_unamb_violation_rate: 0.26\n    deepseek_unamb_violation_rate: 0.34\n    qwen3_delta_pp: 34.2\n    deepseek_delta_pp: 31.4\n    api_failure_rate: 0.008\n    openrouter_timeout_episodes: 3\n    elapsed_hours: ~14\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下OpenRouter proxy对两个open-source模型稳定，failure rate略高于proprietary\n    API （0.8% vs 0.3%）但仍在可接受范围。Qwen3（MoE 235B）和DeepSeek（dense）的violation rates 均高于Claude和GPT\n    models，与paper_framing一致：DeepSeek最高（49.7%），Qwen3中间偏高（43.1%）。 关键是DeepSeek展现\"uniformly\n    high\"特征——per-type χ²不显著（p=0.277, V=0.14）， 所有类型violation rate均高（44-60%），暗示较少type-specific\n    safety training。 Qwen3则有更明确的type differentiation（incomp+lex高，auth_scope较低）。 两个open-source模型的加入使RC3（\"only\n    API models\"）完全化解， 也使C4 interaction matrix从3×6升级到5×6，是star finding的关键数据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-model violation rates (ambiguous condition)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - auth_scope\n    - cond_prec\n    - incomp\n    - lexical\n    - coref\n    - scopal\n    - overall\n    rows:\n    - - qwen3-235b\n      - 0.26\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.431\n    - - deepseek-v3\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.497\n  - name: Binary effect per model\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - amb_rate\n    - unamb_rate\n    - delta_pp\n    - mcnemar_p\n    rows:\n    - - qwen3-235b\n      - 0.602\n      - 0.26\n      - 34.2\n      - <1e-18\n    - - deepseek-v3\n      - 0.654\n      - 0.34\n      - 31.4\n      - <1e-17\n  figures_description:\n  - Open-source vs proprietary model comparison bar chart\n  analysis: 'Open-source数据补全5-model matrix。DeepSeek的uniform vulnerability pattern（V=0.14,\n    n.s.） 与Claude的strong differentiation（V=0.24, p=0.003）形成最大对比， 支持\"safety training\n    selectivity\"叙事：more targeted safety training → more differentiated profile。 C1在所有5个模型上replicate，binary\n    effect +25.3pp to +39.0pp，无例外。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '3,000 episodes统计分析：binary effect + omnibus χ² + TOST + model×type\n    interaction + logistic regression + power analysis + information delta + inter-model\n    agreement。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    c1_pooled_delta_pp: 34.0\n    c1_pooled_or: 15.1\n    c1_or_ci:\n    - 10.78\n    - 21.17\n    c1_mcnemar_p: <0.0001\n    c1_bootstrap_ci:\n    - 31.2\n    - 36.9\n    c1_per_model_all_significant: true\n    c1_per_model_min_delta: 25.7\n    c1_per_model_max_delta: 39.0\n    c2_omnibus_chi2: 28.02\n    c2_omnibus_p: 3.6e-05\n    c2_cramers_v: 0.137\n    c2_power_actual: 0.993\n    c2_mde: 0.093\n    c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs: 8/15\n    c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs: 4/15\n    c2_3tier_high: incompleteness 53.6%\n    c2_3tier_mid: lexical 42.8%, auth_scope 41.6%, scopal 39.4%, CP 36.8%\n    c2_3tier_low: coreferential 31.6%\n    c3_spec_rate: 0.44\n    c3_ling_rate: 0.379\n    c3_delta_pp: 6.08\n    c3_chi2: 5.73\n    c3_p: 0.017\n    c3_v: 0.062\n    c3_or: 1.29\n    c3_or_ci:\n    - 1.05\n    - 1.58\n    c3_within_judge_gpt41_p: 0.059\n    c3_within_judge_gpt54_p: 0.157\n    c4_model_main_chi2: 31.02\n    c4_model_main_p: 3.0e-06\n    c4_model_main_v: 0.102\n    c4_amb_only_chi2: 24.01\n    c4_amb_only_p: 7.9e-05\n    c4_auth_scope_range_pp: 52\n    c4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n    c4_cp_range_pp: 6\n    c4_fleiss_kappa: 0.384\n    c4_gpt54_per_type_chi2_p: 0.0003\n    c4_claude_per_type_chi2_p: 0.003\n    c4_deepseek_per_type_chi2_p: 0.277\n    logistic_condition_amb_coef: 2.278\n    logistic_condition_amb_z: 19.65\n    logistic_condition_amb_p: <0.001\n    logistic_token_delta_coef: 0.022\n    logistic_token_delta_z: 3.49\n    logistic_token_delta_p: 0.0005\n    inter_model_same_wrong_rate: 0.27\n    inter_model_divergent_rate: 0.42\n    systematic_nocuity_identified: true\n    c2_post_hoc_power_v0137: 0.993\n    c3_post_hoc_power_delta6pp: 0.72\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下所有统计分析产出clean、强显著结果。C1 binary effect +34.0pp（OR=15.1） 在5个模型上全部replicate，bootstrap\n    CI不含0，是\"无争议\"级别的evidence。 C2 omnibus χ²高度显著（p=3.6e-5），V=0.137虽然按常规标准\"small\"， 但power=0.993（MDE=0.093远小于observed\n    V=0.137），说明我们有充足power检测到 这个real but modest effect。3-tier结构在TOST下成立：incompleteness独立一档，\n    中间4类型mutual equivalence at ±15pp，coreferential独立一档。 C3 layer effect在aggregate上显著（p=0.017）但within-judge分析fragile——\n    best档下这被正确framed为\"suggestive\"而非\"confirmed\"，reviewer接受这个honest disclosure。 C4是star\n    finding：model main effect p=3.0e-6，auth_scope 52pp range是最dramatic数据点， per-model\n    type χ²展示GPT-5.4和Claude有强type differentiation而DeepSeek没有。 Logistic regression确认ambiguity是dominant\n    predictor（coef=2.278, z=19.65）， token delta显著但远弱于condition effect（coef=0.022,\n    z=3.49）， 排除\"信息量差异\"作为confound的主要解释。 Inter-model agreement分析发现27% systematic nocuity（所有模型converge\n    on same wrong answer）， 支持B&K extension讨论。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: C1 Binary Effect Summary (5 models)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - delta_pp\n    - or\n    - or_ci_lower\n    - or_ci_upper\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - Claude\n      - 25.7\n      - 8.92\n      - 5.61\n      - 14.19\n      - <1e-17\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 34.2\n      - 14.87\n      - 9.12\n      - 24.24\n      - <1e-18\n    - - GPT-4.1\n      - 34.7\n      - 15.31\n      - 9.56\n      - 24.52\n      - <1e-19\n    - - GPT-5.4\n      - 38.3\n      - 18.44\n      - 11.02\n      - 30.85\n      - <1e-20\n    - - DeepSeek\n      - 39.0\n      - 19.21\n      - 11.34\n      - 32.56\n      - <1e-17\n    - - Pooled\n      - 34.0\n      - 15.1\n      - 10.78\n      - 21.17\n      - <0.0001\n  - name: C2 Type Hierarchy (ambiguous condition, pooled 5 models)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - violation_rate\n    - tier\n    - rank\n    rows:\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 0.536\n      - high\n      - 1\n    - - lexical\n      - 0.428\n      - mid\n      - 2\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - 0.416\n      - mid\n      - 3\n    - - scopal\n      - 0.394\n      - mid\n      - 4\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - 0.368\n      - mid\n      - 5\n    - - coreferential\n      - 0.316\n      - low\n      - 6\n  - name: C4 Model × Type Interaction Matrix (ambiguous condition)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - GPT-5.4\n    - GPT-4.1\n    - Claude\n    - Qwen3\n    - DeepSeek\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.26\n      - 0.6\n    - - cond_prec\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.38\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.54\n    - - lexical\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.54\n    - - coreferential\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.44\n    - - scopal\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.48\n  - name: Logistic Regression (full model)\n    columns:\n    - predictor\n    - coef\n    - se\n    - z\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - condition_amb\n      - 2.278\n      - 0.116\n      - 19.65\n      - <0.001\n    - - token_delta\n      - 0.022\n      - 0.006\n      - 3.49\n      - 0.0005\n    - - model_claude\n      - -0.583\n      - 0.098\n      - -5.95\n      - <0.001\n    - - model_deepseek\n      - 0.412\n      - 0.095\n      - 4.34\n      - <0.001\n    - - type_incomp\n      - 0.531\n      - 0.112\n      - 4.74\n      - <0.001\n    - - type_coref\n      - -0.447\n      - 0.118\n      - -3.79\n      - 0.0002\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2: Forest plot — per-model delta_pp with 95% bootstrap CI, pooled diamond\n    at bottom'\n  - 'Figure 3: 5×6 heatmap — violation rate by model × type, color gradient red(high)-blue(low),\n    auth_scope column shows dramatic gradient'\n  - 'Supplementary: TOST equivalence plot — 15 pairwise comparisons with ±15pp and\n    ±10pp margins'\n  analysis: 'plan_004是paper的statistical backbone。Best档下所有5 claims获得统计支持： C1无争议（all\n    p<1e-17），C2 hierarchy real but modest（V=0.137, power=0.993）， C3 honest disclosure（aggregate\n    p=0.017, within-judge fragile）， C4 star finding（interaction解释了C3的fragility——layer\n    effect是model-dependent的）。 Logistic regression的condition_amb coef=2.278 dominant所有其他predictors，\n    是causal claim的最强统计evidence。Token delta作为control variable显著但弱， 排除information asymmetry\n    confound。\n\n    '\n- name: error_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '从full study中采样violation traces，分类failure modes， 交叉类型/模型/领域分布分析，visibility\n    mechanism比较。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_traces_analyzed: 300\n    gpt54_traces: 123\n    gpt41_traces: 122\n    additional_model_traces: 55\n    failure_mode_categories: 4\n    auth_scope_dominant_fm: unauthorized_escalation\n    auth_scope_dominant_pct:\n    - 0.72\n    - 0.83\n    incomp_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action\n    incomp_dominant_pct:\n    - 0.61\n    - 0.66\n    scopal_dominant_fm: scope_misapplication\n    scopal_dominant_pct:\n    - 0.76\n    - 0.74\n    lexical_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action\n    lexical_dominant_pct:\n    - 0.71\n    - 0.53\n    cp_dominant_fm_1: scope_misapplication\n    cp_dominant_fm_2: arbitrary_rule_selection\n    coref_dominant_fm: flat distribution (no single dominant)\n    types_same_dominant_fm_across_models: 5/6\n    divergent_type: coreferential\n    awareness_rate_gpt54: 0.041\n    awareness_rate_gpt41: 0.107\n    surface_adoption_rate: '>0.88 all types'\n    escalate_to_user_rate: <0.01\n    ling_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 0.39\n    spec_layer_scope_misapplication_pct: 0.15\n    max_cross_domain_delta_pp: 13\n    auto_intercoder_4cat_agreement: 0.8\n    auto_intercoder_kappa: 0.594\n    kappa_paradox_affected_types:\n    - lexical\n    - scopal\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下error analysis产出清晰的type-diagnostic failure signatures。\n    5/6 types在两个模型间有相同dominant failure mode——这是\"failure modes are type-specific, not\n    model-specific\"的核心evidence。唯一divergence是coreferential（flat distribution）， 但这本身是informative：coreferential\n    ambiguity触发多样化解读策略， 部分解释其lowest violation rate（agents sometimes pause rather than\n    guess,  conservative_refusal 6-11%）。 Ambiguity Blindness的hard data（awareness <5-11%）是paper的highlight\n    qualitative finding—— 将Named Concept升级为Empirical Finding。gpt-4.1比gpt-5.4 awareness更高（10.7%\n    vs 4.1%）， 支持\"frontier models more action-oriented\"的nuance。 Layer mechanism清晰：ling→misparse（scope_misapplication\n    39%），spec→guess-and-act （unauthorized_escalation + assumption_based_action dominate），\n    provides the qualitative WHY behind the quantitative C3 layer gap。 κ=0.594（moderate）被kappa\n    paradox部分deflate——lexical 91.7% agreement但κ=0.0。 Best档下plan_009 human anchor将这个数字升至≥0.70。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Failure mode × type distribution (gpt-5.4)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - unauthorized_escalation\n    - assumption_based_action\n    - scope_misapplication\n    - arbitrary_rule_selection\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.16\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.04\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.07\n    - - scopal\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.08\n    - - lexical\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.15\n      - 0.06\n    - - cond_prec\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.29\n    - - coreferential\n      - 0.16\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.24\n  - name: Ambiguity Blindness metrics\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - awareness_rate\n    - surface_adoption\n    - escalate_to_user\n    - conservative_refusal\n    rows:\n    - - gpt-5.4\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.912\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.039\n    - - gpt-4.1\n      - 0.107\n      - 0.881\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.028\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 5: Stacked bar chart — failure mode distribution by type, showing type-diagnostic\n    signatures'\n  - 'Figure 6: Side-by-side gpt-5.4 vs gpt-4.1 per-type failure mode bars, highlighting\n    5/6 convergence'\n  - 'Figure 7: Annotated trace pair — CP conflict detection behavior vs scopal surface\n    adoption'\n  analysis: 'Error analysis是paper的EMNLP highest-value section（§6 Analysis）。 Type-specific\n    failure signatures将quantitative hierarchy（C2）翻译为mechanistic explanation： 为什么incompleteness最危险？因为agents在信息缺失时default\n    to assumption_based_action。 为什么coreferential最低？因为agents有时通过tool responses partial\n    disambiguation， 或采取conservative_refusal。这连接到Disambiguation Channel Framework。\n\n    '\n- name: reliability_test\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes，\n    计算ICC评估per-clause violation rate的test-retest reliability。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 360\n    completed_episodes: 360\n    icc_overall: 0.919\n    icc_ci:\n    - 0.892\n    - 0.94\n    icc_binary: 0.847\n    icc_gpt54: 0.921\n    icc_gpt41: 0.918\n    icc_interpretation: excellent (>0.90)\n    per_type_icc_scopal: 0.989\n    per_type_icc_lexical: 0.981\n    per_type_icc_coref: 0.976\n    per_type_icc_auth: 0.857\n    per_type_icc_cp: 0.856\n    per_type_icc_incomp: 0.807\n    bootstrap_ci_width_key_comparisons: <10pp\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下ICC=0.919（excellent）完全化解RC10（\"API sampling noise\"）。 三次independent\n    replicates的per-clause violation rates高度一致， 说明observed effects反映stable model behavior而非random\n    API noise。 Binary ICC=0.847（good）略低因为binary比rate-level更粗粒度。 Per-type ICC pattern\n    mirrors layer hierarchy：ling-layer ICC全excellent（0.976-0.989）， spec-layer ICC全good（0.807-0.857）——spec-layer\n    less reproducible因为agents在 缺乏external disambiguation channel时每次run可能\"猜\"不同，但仍然是good\n    level。 这个ICC pattern本身是Disambiguation Channel Framework的convergent evidence。 ±8pp\n    noise（先前在MVP/diag间观察到）在ICC=0.919下完全compatible—— expected standard error给定ICC和N正好produce\n    this magnitude of variation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ICC by type and layer\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - icc\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - scopal\n      - linguistic\n      - 0.989\n      - excellent\n    - - lexical\n      - linguistic\n      - 0.981\n      - excellent\n    - - coreferential\n      - linguistic\n      - 0.976\n      - excellent\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - specification\n      - 0.857\n      - good\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - specification\n      - 0.856\n      - good\n    - - incompleteness\n      - specification\n      - 0.807\n      - good\n    - - overall\n      - '-'\n      - 0.919\n      - excellent\n  figures_description:\n  - ICC forest plot by type — ling-layer cluster at top, spec-layer cluster below,\n    clear separation\n  analysis: 'Reliability data有双重作用：(1) 直接回应RC10，(2) ICC per-type pattern 作为Disambiguation\n    Channel Framework的independent evidence line。 Paper中报告在§4 Method作为design validation。\n\n    '\n- name: realism_validation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '合成clause与DRIP-R自然ambiguity的linguistic property comparison： sentence\n    length, parse depth, Flesch-Kincaid, TTR, KS tests。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_synthetic: 300\n    n_drip_r_reference: 127\n    sentence_length_ks_p: 0.34\n    parse_depth_ks_p: 0.18\n    flesch_kincaid_ks_p: 0.52\n    ttr_ks_p: 0.41\n    all_ks_nonsignificant: true\n    synthetic_flesch_mean: 12.1\n    drip_r_flesch_mean: 11.7\n    synthetic_length_mean: 22.4\n    drip_r_length_mean: 24.1\n    discriminator_accuracy: null\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下所有KS tests non-significant（all p>0.10），表明合成clause的linguistic\n    surface properties 与DRIP-R自然ambiguity在统计上不可区分。这不证明\"identical\"，但回应RC4的ecological\n    validity concern： 合成clause不是artifically简化或夸张的——它们的sentence length、readability、lexical\n    diversity 均在自然policy ambiguity的分布范围内。Flesch-Kincaid均值几乎相同（12.1 vs 11.7）， 说明matched-pair\n    design没有系统性地改变readability。 Best档下无需discriminator test——KS tests足够。这个分析报告在§4 Method或Appendix，\n    一段话即可，不是major contribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Linguistic property comparison\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - synthetic_mean\n    - synthetic_sd\n    - drip_r_mean\n    - drip_r_sd\n    - ks_statistic\n    - ks_p\n    rows:\n    - - sentence_length\n      - 22.4\n      - 8.3\n      - 24.1\n      - 9.7\n      - 0.098\n      - 0.34\n    - - parse_depth\n      - 5.2\n      - 1.8\n      - 5.6\n      - 2.1\n      - 0.112\n      - 0.18\n    - - flesch_kincaid\n      - 12.1\n      - 2.4\n      - 11.7\n      - 2.9\n      - 0.076\n      - 0.52\n    - - type_token_ratio\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.089\n      - 0.41\n  figures_description:\n  - Paired density plots for each metric — synthetic (blue) vs DRIP-R (orange), showing\n    overlap\n  analysis: 'Realism validation是defensive analysis，回应RC4。Best档下clean pass， 一段话在Method\n    section + density plots在Appendix。不需要extended discussion。\n\n    '\n- name: judge_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'LLM-as-judge calibration：100 episodes × 2 human annotators， 计算judge\n    precision/recall/F1 against human ground truth，per-severity agreement。 这是best档的\"single\n    most critical missing validation\"。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_episodes_sampled: 100\n    n_human_annotators: 2\n    human_inter_annotator_kappa: 0.87\n    human_inter_annotator_agreement: 0.93\n    judge_human_f1: 0.91\n    judge_human_precision: 0.89\n    judge_human_recall: 0.93\n    judge_human_kappa: 0.84\n    severity_high_f1: 0.94\n    severity_mid_f1: 0.88\n    severity_low_f1: 0.82\n    gpt54_judge_f1: 0.9\n    gpt41_judge_f1: 0.92\n    judge_asymmetry_delta_f1: 0.02\n    c5_human_anchor_n: 25\n    c5_human_anchor_fm_kappa: 0.76\n    c5_human_anchor_fm_agreement: 0.84\n    c5_pre_anchor_auto_kappa: 0.594\n    c5_post_anchor_interpretation: good (≥0.70)\n  result_rationale: 'Best档的核心假设是judge calibration强确认：F1≥0.85且κ≥0.80。 F1=0.91意味着LLM\n    judge的violation labels与human expert高度一致—— 93% recall说明judge几乎不会miss true violations（false\n    negative低）， 89% precision说明少量false positive但在可接受范围。 Human inter-annotator κ=0.87（almost\n    perfect）为human ground truth本身的质量提供保证。 Cross-judge asymmetry极小（ΔF1=0.02），化解RC3\n    Note中\"Claude judged by gpt-5.4, gpt-5.4 judged by gpt-4.1\"的bias concern——两个judge\n    equally accurate。\n\n    C5 human anchor是关键upgrade：25 failure mode traces的human coding κ=0.76（good）， 从plan_005的automated\n    κ=0.594（moderate）升级。这个upgrade使C5从\"moderate automated\" 变为\"validated\"，让failure mode\n    taxonomy的per-type signatures获得human-backed credibility。 κ从0.594→0.76的jump合理：human\n    annotators使用refined codebook， automated cross-coding的main disagreement在unauthorized_escalation↔inappropriate_action边界\n    这个边界对human更容易区分（有trace context）。\n\n    整体而言，judge calibration data使整个measurement chain验证完成： episode→judge label（F1=0.91）→violation\n    rate→statistical tests→claims。 Paper可以将此作为methodological strength呈现，而非limitation。\n    在5/8 distilled papers中这是standard practice，我们的F1=0.91处于top tier。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Judge calibration summary\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - human_inter_annotator_κ\n      - 0.87\n      - almost perfect\n    - - judge_human_F1\n      - 0.91\n      - excellent\n    - - judge_human_precision\n      - 0.89\n      - high\n    - - judge_human_recall\n      - 0.93\n      - very high\n    - - judge_human_κ\n      - 0.84\n      - almost perfect\n    - - gpt-5.4_judge_F1\n      - 0.9\n      - excellent\n    - - gpt-4.1_judge_F1\n      - 0.92\n      - excellent\n    - - cross_judge_ΔF1\n      - 0.02\n      - negligible asymmetry\n  - name: Per-severity calibration\n    columns:\n    - severity_tier\n    - n\n    - F1\n    - precision\n    - recall\n    rows:\n    - - high (clear violation)\n      - 38\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.97\n    - - mid (ambiguous judgment)\n      - 31\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.91\n    - - low (borderline)\n      - 31\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.8\n  - name: C5 human anchor upgrade\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - pre_anchor\n    - post_anchor\n    - change\n    rows:\n    - - coding_method\n      - automated (LLM cross-coding)\n      - human expert + codebook\n      - upgraded\n    - - n_traces\n      - 60\n      - 25\n      - '-'\n    - - agreement\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.84\n      - +4pp\n    - - κ\n      - 0.594\n      - 0.76\n      - '+0.166'\n    - - interpretation\n      - moderate\n      - good\n      - one level up\n  figures_description:\n  - Confusion matrix heatmap — judge vs human labels, 3 severity tiers\n  - Per-type calibration dot plot — F1 by ambiguity type, showing consistent calibration\n  analysis: 'Judge calibration是best档与其他档位的分界线。F1=0.91和κ=0.84验证了整条measurement chain，\n    使reviewer无法质疑\"your LLM judge might be systematically wrong\"。 Per-severity分析显示high-severity\n    cases calibration最好（F1=0.94）， low-severity borderline cases略差（F1=0.82）但仍adequate。\n    C5 human anchor κ=0.76使failure mode taxonomy从\"moderate automated coding\"升级为 \"validated\"，这是qualitative\n    claim的credibility threshold。 Best档下这些结果使paper可以说\"三重验证：perturbation control + ICC\n    0.919 + judge F1 0.91 = strongest causal evidence chain in the agent safety literature\"。\n\n    '\n- name: perturbation_control\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '30 non-ambiguity perturbation pairs × 2 conditions × 2 models (gpt-5.4,\n    gpt-4.1) = 120 episodes。 验证ambiguity-specific causation vs general prompt brittleness。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 120\n    perturbation_types:\n      synonym_substitution: 15\n      clause_reordering: 15\n    delta_perturb_pp: 3.33\n    delta_perturb_ci:\n    - -3.0\n    - 9.67\n    ci_contains_zero: true\n    delta_ambiguity_pp: 36.5\n    net_delta_pp: 33.17\n    ratio: 0.091\n    verdict: PASS\n    synonym_delta_pp: 2.67\n    reorder_delta_pp: 4.0\n  result_rationale: 'Best档下perturbation control完美PASS：Δ_perturb=3.33pp（CI含0）， ratio=0.091远低于0.15\n    PASS阈值。这意味着non-ambiguity surface changes （synonym substitution、clause reordering）对violation\n    rate几乎无影响， 而ambiguity manipulation产生+36.5pp massive effect。 Net effect=33.17pp（36.5\n    - 3.33），基本等于gross effect—— prompt brittleness不是confound。\n\n    Synonym substitution比clause reordering effect更小（2.67pp vs 4.00pp）， 因为reordering至少改变了信息的salience/processing\n    order，但两者都远小于ambiguity effect。 CI宽度~12.7pp在N=120下是expected的（power analysis预测width\n    ~15pp at N=120）， 关键是upper bound 9.67pp < 10pp threshold，足以排除substantial prompt\n    sensitivity confound。\n\n    这个PASS verdict使C1可以claim\"strongest causal evidence\"—— matched-pair design（internal\n    validity）+ perturbation control（specificity）+  ICC 0.919（reliability）= 三重验证。完全化解RC11（Dream\n    A9 best tier \"strongest point\"）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Perturbation control results\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - Δ_perturb\n      - 3.33pp\n    - - Δ_perturb 95% CI\n      - '[-3.0, 9.67]'\n    - - CI contains 0\n      - 'yes'\n    - - Δ_ambiguity\n      - 36.5pp\n    - - Δ_net\n      - 33.17pp\n    - - ratio (perturb/ambiguity)\n      - 0.091\n    - - verdict\n      - PASS\n  - name: By perturbation type\n    columns:\n    - perturb_type\n    - n_pairs\n    - delta_pp\n    - direction\n    rows:\n    - - synonym_substitution\n      - 15\n      - 2.67\n      - slight increase\n    - - clause_reordering\n      - 15\n      - 4.0\n      - slight increase\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: Δ_ambiguity (36.5pp) vs Δ_perturb (3.33pp) with CI error bars — dramatic\n    visual contrast'\n  analysis: 'Perturbation control是causal inference的keystone。Best档下PASS verdict 使paper能够claim\n    ambiguity-SPECIFIC causation而非general prompt sensitivity。 这在agent safety literature中是unique的——DRIP-R、PhantomPolicy均无此控制。\n    报告在§4 Method，一段话+一个figure。\n\n    '\n- name: classifier_poc\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large fine-tuning for binary ambiguity detection， 5-fold\n    CV on 300 clause pairs (500 total clauses with augmentation)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n    total_clauses: 500\n    folds: 5\n    binary_f1: 0.81\n    binary_precision: 0.79\n    binary_recall: 0.83\n    binary_fpr: 0.044\n    macro_f1: 0.63\n    per_type_f1:\n      conditional_precedence: 0.94\n      scopal: 0.75\n      coreferential: 0.7\n      authorization_scope: 0.58\n      lexical: 0.39\n      incompleteness: 0.34\n    best_type: conditional_precedence\n    worst_type: incompleteness\n    training_gpu_hours: 6\n  result_rationale: \"Best档下classifier PoC达到binary F1=0.81——作为PoC（not main contribution）这已经足够impressive，\\\n    \\ 说明ambiguity detection是computationally feasible。 Per-type F1分布与ambiguity的语言学性质一致：\\\n    \\ - CP highest（0.94）：explicit rule conflicts有清晰的lexical markers（\\\"however\\\", \\\"\\\n    notwithstanding\\\"），\\n  容易被transformer捕获\\n- scopal/coref mid（0.70-0.75）：有structural\\\n    \\ patterns（quantifier scope, pronoun reference） - auth_scope moderate（0.58）：boundary\\\n    \\ terms partially detectable but context-dependent - lexical/incomp low（0.34-0.39）：最难detect——lexical\\\n    \\ ambiguity需要world knowledge，\\n  incompleteness是\\\"absence of information\\\"，transformer难以detect\\\n    \\ what's NOT there\\n\\nBinary F1 >> macro F1（0.81 vs 0.63）因为binary task只需detect\\\n    \\ \\\"is this ambiguous?\\\"， 不需区分type。FPR=0.044极低——几乎不会将unambiguous clause误判为ambiguous。\\n\\\n    Best档下这个PoC放在Appendix而非main contribution（per framing guidance）， 但作为\\\"practical\\\n    \\ applicability\\\"evidence增强paper的impact narrative。 Chantree et al. (2006) nocuous\\\n    \\ ambiguity detection lineage在Related Work中建立连接。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: Classifier performance summary\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - binary_F1\n      - 0.81\n    - - binary_precision\n      - 0.79\n    - - binary_recall\n      - 0.83\n    - - binary_FPR\n      - 0.044\n    - - macro_F1 (6-type)\n      - 0.63\n  - name: Per-type F1\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - f1\n    - difficulty_explanation\n    rows:\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - 0.94\n      - explicit conflict markers\n    - - scopal\n      - 0.75\n      - structural scope patterns\n    - - coreferential\n      - 0.7\n      - referential structure detectable\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - 0.58\n      - context-dependent boundaries\n    - - lexical\n      - 0.39\n      - requires world knowledge\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 0.34\n      - absence detection is hard\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-type F1 bar chart with error bars from 5-fold CV\n  - Confusion matrix (6-type) showing off-diagonal concentration\n  analysis: Classifier PoC的per-type difficulty gradient是theoretically informative——\n    它mirror了human ambiguity detection difficulty。CP的near-perfect detection vs incompleteness的near-chance\n    performance支持Disambiguation Channel Framework： types with explicit linguistic\n    markers are detectable; types defined by information absence are not。 Best档下这个insight在Discussion\n    section获得一段话。\n","numLines":1155,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1155}}}
